 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Deterministic model of the concurrent crawler: the HTML parser is injected as a map from URL to the URLs found on that page (absent key = no links). Starting at startUrl, visit every reachable URL whose hostname (text between \"http://\" and the next \"/\") equals the start hostname exactly; other hosts are neither recorded nor crawled. Return the unique visited URLs sorted lexicographically, since concurrent discovery order is not deterministic.",
  "provenance": [
